(Slide 22: Either ... or (The Positive Choice) | Use "either... or" to talk about a choice) Tj
T*
(between TWO possibilities. It means one OR the other. | Grammar Rule | "To cure your FOMO, you) Tj
T*
(can either delete the app or mute your friends." | "Either you put your phone away, or I will) Tj
