(Slide 23: Neither ... nor (The Negative Choice) | Important Note: The verb is usually POSITIVE) Tj
T*
(because neither is already a negative word! | Grammar Rule | Use "neither... nor" to mean "NOT) Tj
T*
(the first one AND NOT the second one." | "He uses neither Facebook nor Instagram." | "Neither) Tj
